  "message": "Rho-Bank guidance recommends enabling travel notifications for international use when required by the card’s risk controls. I couldn’t find an official step-by-step setup procedure for the Platinum Rewards Card. Please sign in to the Rho-Bank mobile app or online banking and look for a travel notification or card security option. If you don’t see it, call customer service at 1-800-RHO-BANK and provide your travel destination (Japan) and travel dates."
